#. type: TH
#: condinapt-minios.7:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "MiniOS CondinAPT Integration"
msgstr "MiniOS CondinAPT-Integration"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt-minios.7:6
msgid "condinapt-minios - use CondinAPT in MiniOS build modules"
msgstr "condinapt-minios – verwenden Sie CondinAPT in MiniOS-Buildmodulen"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt-minios.7:11
msgid ""
"MiniOS modules use \\f[B]condinapt\\f[R](1) to select and install APT "
"packages from the active build configuration.  This page documents the "
"MiniOS staging paths, module layout, and standard filter map.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"MiniOS-Module verwenden B<condinapt>(1), um APT-Pakete aus der aktiven Build-"
"Konfiguration auszuwählen und zu installieren. Diese Seite dokumentiert die "
"MiniOS-Staging-Pfade, die Modulstruktur und die Standard-Filtermap."

#. type: SH
#: condinapt-minios.7:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "MODULE INTEGRATION"
msgstr "MODULINTEGRATION"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt-minios.7:14
msgid ""
"The builder discovers modules through the selected environment directory:"
msgstr "Der Builder erkennt Module über das gewählte Umgebungsverzeichnis:"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt-minios.7:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "linux-live/environments/E<lt>desktopE<gt>/\n"
msgstr "linux-live/environments/E<lt>desktopE<gt>/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt-minios.7:20
msgid "Entries there are normally links to reusable module sources under:"
msgstr ""
"Einträge dort sind normalerweise Links zu wiederverwendbaren Modulquellen "
"unter:"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt-minios.7:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "linux-live/scripts/E<lt>NN-module-nameE<gt>/\n"
msgstr "linux-live/scripts/E<lt>NN-module-nameE<gt>/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt-minios.7:32
msgid ""
"During the install stage, the builder copies the module\\[cq]s "
"\\f[B]install\\f[R] script to \\f[B]/install\\f[R] in the chroot.  It also "
"stages \\f[B]condinapt\\f[R], \\f[B]condinapt.map\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]packages.list\\f[R], and the generated build configuration at the "
"chroot root.  Do not rely on \\f[B]$CWD\\f[R] or an installed \\f[B]/usr/"
"share/minios-live\\f[R] path from inside a module script.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Während der Installationsphase kopiert der Builder das B<install>-Skript des "
"Moduls nach B</install> im Chroot. Zusätzlich werden B<condinapt>, "
"B<condinapt.map>, B<packages.list> und die generierte Build-Konfiguration im "
"Chroot-Stamm bereitgestellt. Verlassen Sie sich in einem Modulsript nicht "
"auf B<$CWD> oder einen installierten Pfad B</usr/share/minios-live>."

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt-minios.7:34
msgid "A minimal \\f[B]install\\f[R] script is:\\fR"
msgstr "Ein minimales B<install>-Skript ist:"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt-minios.7:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"#!/bin/bash\n"
"set -e\n"
"set -o pipefail\n"
"set -u\n"
msgstr ""
"#!/bin/bash\n"
"set -e\n"
"set -o pipefail\n"
"set -u\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt-minios.7:43
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\&. /minioslib || exit 1\n"
"\\&. /minios_build.conf || exit 1\n"
msgstr ""
"&. /minioslib || exit 1\n"
"&. /minios_build.conf || exit 1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt-minios.7:49
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"SCRIPT_DIR=\\[dq]$(dirname \\[dq]$(readlink -f \\[dq]$0\\[dq])\\[dq])\\[dq]\n"
"/condinapt \\[rs]\n"
"    -l \\[dq]${SCRIPT_DIR}/packages.list\\[dq] \\[rs]\n"
"    -c \\[dq]${SCRIPT_DIR}/minios_build.conf\\[dq] \\[rs]\n"
"    -m \\[dq]${SCRIPT_DIR}/condinapt.map\\[dq]\n"
msgstr ""
"SCRIPT_DIR=\\[dq]$(dirname \\[dq]$(readlink -f \\[dq]$0\\[dq])\\[dq])\\[dq]\n"
"/condinapt \\ \n"
"    -l \\[dq]${SCRIPT_DIR}/packages.list\\[dq] \\ \n"
"    -c \\[dq]${SCRIPT_DIR}/minios_build.conf\\[dq] \\ \n"
"    -m \\[dq]${SCRIPT_DIR}/condinapt.map\\[dq]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt-minios.7:52
msgid "The standard module may contain:"
msgstr "Das Standardmodul kann enthalten:"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt-minios.7:64
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"NN-module-name/\n"
"|-- packages.list\n"
"|-- install\n"
"|-- skip_conditions.conf       # optional\n"
"|-- rootcopy-install/          # optional\n"
"|-- build                      # optional\n"
"|-- patches/                   # optional, used by build\n"
"|-- is_dkms_build              # optional DKMS marker\n"
"|-- rootcopy-postinstall/      # optional\n"
"\\[ga]-- postinstall                # optional\n"
msgstr ""
"NN-module-name/\n"
"|-- packages.list\n"
"|-- install\n"
"|-- skip_conditions.conf       # optional\n"
"|-- rootcopy-install/          # optional\n"
"|-- build                      # optional\n"
"|-- patches/                   # optional, wird von build verwendet\n"
"|-- is_dkms_build              # optionaler DKMS-Marker\n"
"|-- rootcopy-postinstall/      # optional\n"
"|-- postinstall                # optional\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt-minios.7:69
msgid ""
"See \\f[B]linux-live/scripts/10-example/README.md\\f[R] for the complete "
"module lifecycle, ownership manifests, naming, and environment-link "
"instructions.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Siehe B<linux-live/scripts/10-example/README.md> für den vollständigen Modul-"
"Lebenszyklus, Besitznachweise, Namensgebung und Anweisungen zur Verknüpfung "
"von Umgebungen."

